mapping "W2784.1" source="W2784" target="302981008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.71 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2784 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of base W27 SNOMED CT 302981008, with place (other
        specified place) and activity (vital activity such as rest, sleep, meals, personal hygiene).
        Target SNOMED CT 441193 = (302981008), the verified Athena crosswalk target for base W27 (ICD10
        concept 45756280 -> 441193). The target is the standard concept; the [X]-prefixed place-specific
        SNOMED CT siblings (e.g. 220636009) are non-standard in OMOP. Target fully captures the core
        accident event but does not encode the Swedish place/activity subdivisions, so it legitimately
        subsumes the source (broader). High tier: verified crosswalk to parent, one-level breadth
        mismatch on the supplementary place/activity axis.
        """
}
